WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:03.109
(dramatic music)

00:00:05.684 --> 00:00:06.517
- Squaller!

00:00:06.517 --> 00:00:07.350
(horse neighs)

00:00:12.279 --> 00:00:13.112
(door slamming)
(Alina shrieking)

00:00:13.112 --> 00:00:13.945
- [in Fjerdan] Witch!

00:00:15.722 --> 00:00:17.113
- Please!

00:00:17.113 --> 00:00:18.596
(horse whinnying)

00:00:18.596 --> 00:00:19.912
(man groaning)

00:00:19.912 --> 00:00:21.964
- No! Please! Please!

00:00:21.964 --> 00:00:25.406
I'm not Grisha! I'm a mapmaker!

00:00:26.505 --> 00:00:29.088
(man groaning)

00:00:31.612 --> 00:00:33.504
- [in Fjerdan] What you are is a witch.

00:00:38.241 --> 00:00:40.185
(hooves thundering)

00:00:40.185 --> 00:00:42.685
(tense music)

00:00:47.382 --> 00:00:48.382
(fighter shouts in Fjerdan)

00:00:57.064 --> 00:00:58.222
- [in Fjerdan] Darkling.

00:01:10.763 --> 00:01:12.831
(wind rustling)

00:01:12.831 --> 00:01:13.831
- And fight!

00:01:15.948 --> 00:01:18.598
(dramatic music)
- (women groaning)

00:01:26.238 --> 00:01:27.321
- We go again.

00:01:28.735 --> 00:01:29.568
- Fight.

00:01:31.298 --> 00:01:35.740
(tense music)
(women groaning)

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:37.002
- Your tracker friend also liked it

00:01:37.002 --> 00:01:38.571
when I put him on his back.

00:01:40.763 --> 00:01:43.616
(dramatic music)

00:01:43.616 --> 00:01:44.457
(punch thwacking)

00:01:47.249 --> 00:01:48.965
(claws thrusting)

00:01:48.965 --> 00:01:49.815
(alternate dimension shrieking)

00:02:00.181 --> 00:02:01.381
(blade sheathing)

00:02:01.381 --> 00:02:04.131
(blows thumping)

00:02:08.203 --> 00:02:09.144
(blade chinking)

00:02:11.472 --> 00:02:12.309
(table clattering)
(bottle clinking)

00:02:12.309 --> 00:02:13.196
(Mal groaning)

00:02:14.721 --> 00:02:16.304
- Tofin.

00:02:16.304 --> 00:02:17.137
Shit.

00:02:18.237 --> 00:02:19.834
(blade chinking)

00:02:19.834 --> 00:02:21.524
(blade chinking)
(Mal groaning)

00:02:21.524 --> 00:02:22.377
(tense music)

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:25.641
(table leg clacking)

00:02:28.858 --> 00:02:30.574
(blade swishing)

00:02:30.574 --> 00:02:31.754
(Mal groaning)

00:02:31.754 --> 00:02:32.721
(punches thudding)

00:02:41.947 --> 00:02:43.039
(Mal gasping)

00:02:50.728 --> 00:02:51.955
(Mal yelling)

00:02:51.955 --> 00:02:52.890
(flesh rippling)

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:54.673
(punch thwacking)

00:02:56.073 --> 00:02:56.906
(blade clanging)

00:03:00.625 --> 00:03:01.733
(eerie music)

00:03:04.791 --> 00:03:06.466
(deer whining)

00:03:09.771 --> 00:03:11.554
(gun blasting)
(man groaning)

00:03:17.233 --> 00:03:19.000
- That animal's not meant for you.

00:03:21.887 --> 00:03:22.720
(arrow plunging)
(Mal groaning)

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:23.553
- [Alina] Mal!

00:03:23.553 --> 00:03:26.053
(tense music)

00:03:39.497 --> 00:03:42.785
(Alina panting)

00:03:42.785 --> 00:03:46.018
- You chose to betray our people.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:49.253
I was trying to save us.

00:03:52.238 --> 00:03:53.146
(Kirigan groaning)

00:03:56.219 --> 00:03:57.052
- Mal!

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:01.841
- You betrayed us first.

00:04:01.841 --> 00:04:04.591
(sinister music)

00:04:10.483 --> 00:04:12.258
(punching)

00:04:17.465 --> 00:04:20.132
(Alina panting)

00:04:24.756 --> 00:04:25.589
(Alina retching)

00:04:25.589 --> 00:04:26.422
- How dare you?

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:31.330
He gave you everything.

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:36.189
Remember your place.

00:04:36.189 --> 00:04:37.228
(gun blasting)

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:39.603
(gun blasting)

00:04:51.055 --> 00:04:52.660
(gun twirling)

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:53.950
- Still couldn't shoot the pretty face.

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:55.852
I've got to stop doing that.

00:04:55.852 --> 00:04:56.747
(dramatic music)

00:04:59.022 --> 00:05:04.022
(men groaning)
(punches thumping)

00:05:25.174 --> 00:05:26.516
(beast screeching)

